---
title: Dashboard and review workflow
date: '2026-06-16'
tags:
  - added
summary: Source milestone for local spec, plan, build, QA, and diff review through a CLI and dashboard. Merge remains an explicit choice.
---
The source-run workflow brings spec and plan records, an isolated Git worktree
build, a reviewer/fixer QA loop, and saved artifacts together for inspection.
The local dashboard includes a board, project selection, and a worktree diff
panel. The CLI offers separate review, merge, and discard commands; it does not
publish a release or connect to an external issue tracker or CI service.

The former light/dark board stills showed illustrative tasks whose dates extend
beyond this entry. They are withdrawn as evidence of the June milestone. A
measured test-count claim is also withheld until its contemporaneous source is
verified. Real matched product captures and narrated films remain in production.
